{# Cases whose fatal deadline cannot be computed because the fact its term runs
   from has no date recorded. The agenda can only list what exists; this zone is
   what is missing from it, which is why the page needs it at all.

   Collapsed by default: it justifies the page, but it is not what the lawyer reads
   every morning, and expanded it pushed the agenda below the fold. The header stays
   visible, so a blockage never becomes invisible.

   Where an agenda row prints a date, this row prints the state the case is in. There
   is no date to print, and the whole point of the zone is that the application refuses
   to invent one.

   The button posts to the route that records the missing date, through the shared
   action template: the agenda collects the communication date of the summons in its
   own dialog, and every other act stays a link into the case, which is also what a
   browser running no scripts gets. Authorization and audit stay on the existing
   routes.

   @var blockages     list<App\Service\Deadline\DeadlineBlockageView>
   @var filter_fields map active filter, carried by the forms of the row #}

{% from 'deadlines/_icons.html.twig' import triangle, chevron %}

<details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 border-l-2 border-l-amber-400 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-soft overflow-hidden">
    <summary class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-start gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center size-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950/50 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0">
            {{ triangle('size-3.5') }}
        </span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold">
                {{ 'deadlines.blockages.heading'|trans }}
                <span class="ml-1 tnum text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">{{ 'deadlines.blockages.count'|trans({ '%count%': blockages|length }) }}</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">{{ 'deadlines.blockages.description'|trans }}</p>
        </div>
        <span class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-lex-navy dark:text-blue-400">
            <span class="group-open:hidden">{{ 'deadlines.blockages.open'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="hidden group-open:inline">{{ 'deadlines.blockages.close'|trans }}</span>
            {{ chevron('size-4 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180') }}
        </span>
    </summary>

    <div class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800">
        {% for row in blockages %}
            {% set legal_case = row.legalCase() %}
            {% set reason = row.reason() %}
            {% set debtor = legal_case.debtors|length > 0 ? legal_case.debtors|first : null %}
            <div class="px-4 py-3 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-3">
                <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold">
                        <a href="{{ path('case_overview', { id: legal_case.id }) }}" class="hover:underline {{ legal_case.courtCaseNumber ? 'font-mono' : '' }}">{{ legal_case.courtCaseNumber ?: legal_case.caseNumber }}</a>
                        {% if not legal_case.courtCaseNumber %}<span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal">{{ 'deadlines.row.internal_number'|trans }}</span>{% endif %}
                        {% if debtor %}
                            <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-normal" aria-hidden="true">·</span><span class="font-semibold">{{ debtor.name }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide ring-1 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 ring-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-950/40 dark:text-amber-300 dark:ring-amber-900/50">
                            {{ reason.stateLabel()|trans }}
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                        {{ 'deadlines.blockages.missing'|trans }}
                        <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">{{ reason.missingDeadlineLabel()|trans }}</strong>
                        ({{ reason.legalBasisLabel()|trans }}). {{ reason.causeLabel()|trans }}
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">{{ reason.consequenceLabel()|trans }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="shrink-0 self-start lg:self-auto flex">
                    {{ include('deadlines/_row_action.html.twig', {
                        button: row.action,
                        case_id: legal_case.id,
                        style: 'primary',
                        icon: false,
                        filter_fields: filter_fields|default({}),
                    }, with_context = false) }}
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</details>
